{
  "version": 1,
  "note": "Seeded from the live Vehicle Tracking runs on 18 Oct 2026 (Civil 3D 2027 Metric, Vehicle Tracking 2027). Entries start unconfirmed: the first live sighting of each comes back to Claude, who confirms it with c3d_dialog_act (learn=...), which records the exact control fingerprint. Only after that can a task answer it without Claude.",
  "workflows": {
    "vt_follow": {
      "questions": [
        "Which drawing? It is run on a working copy, never the original.",
        "Which vehicle(s), as a library path, e.g. South African Design Vehicles > SANRAL > SU - Single Unit?",
        "For each vehicle: which stages (in, park, reverse, out) and the direction of each (Forwards / Reverse)?",
        "Is a raster layout attached? File, scale and dpi?",
        "If Follow cannot track a line at design speed: accept the reduced speed and record it as a finding, or stop and report?",
        "Clearance to report against (default 0.3 m) and the obstacle layers.",
        "Set the Vehicle Tracking drawing defaults now (1 unit = 1 m, drive on the left, prompt for scale off)?",
        "Outputs: PNG windows, vehicle profiles, where the DWG is saved."
      ]
    },
    "road_production": {
      "questions": [
        "Which road and which drawings (alignment, corridor, PnP, CS)? Work only on the copies in the private staging folder, never in the shared project.",
        "Is the staging copy of the project current? (Refresh it first if a colleague has saved the shared drawings since.)",
        "Has the promote step been agreed with the person (and the colleague who owns the geometry) for any alignment or profile change?",
        "Title-block values: designed / checked / approved / drawn initials by the client's rule, date and revision?",
        "Which plot style (.ctb), and is it installed? If not, where is the file?",
        "Where do the PDFs go (staging path mirroring the shared project), and what file names?",
        "Quantities: which sample line group, and is Compute Materials already run? Stake-out interval (default 10 m)?",
        "Compare against what: the issued PDF book or the client's reference project?"
      ]
    }
  },
